["zh-Hant"],[["「滿來溫泉拉麵」是北投極具代表性的老字號拉麵店，以濃厚的日式懷舊氛圍與平價的台式風味聞名。該店目前已搬遷至新址，若您計畫前往，請務必確認地址以免跑錯至原址的「滿足溫泉拉麵」。\n\n🍜 餐廳基本資訊\n店名：滿來溫泉拉麵 (正宗本店)\n地址：台北市北投區中和街30號（捷運新北投站出口左轉，步行約3分鐘）\n營業時間：\n週二至週日：11:30–15:00, 16:30–20:30\n週一公休\n消費方式：僅收現金，不收服務費（部分評論提到新址狀況，建議以現場為準），不提供預約，需現場候位。\n\n🍱 推薦必點料理\n滿來的口味偏向改良後的台式拉麵，湯頭溫潤且配料豐富。\n\n白湯叉燒拉麵 / 什錦拉麵：經典熱銷主食，什錦拉麵包含蝦、小卷、肉片等多樣海鮮與配料。\n\n招牌炸豆腐：外酥內嫩的必點小菜，點此道菜還能參與店內的「幸運鈴」半價挑戰活動。\n\n溫泉蛋 / 溫泉豆腐：掌握恰到好處的半熟口感，是北投美食的標配。\n\n炸麻吉：深受顧客喜愛的甜點，口感Q彈好吃。",null,[0,87]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/8894208471700630640/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhY1dORVJsZFZha0pGWVZkMFVFMXVUbkJsYTNSM1kycG9NR1ZWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8894208471700630640/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhY1dORVJsZFZha0pGWVZkMFVFMXVUbkJsYTNSM1kycG9NR1ZWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/8894208471700630640/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhY1dORVJsZFZha0pGWVZkMFVFMXVUbkJsYTNSM1kycG9NR1ZWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8894208471700630640/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhY1dORVJsZFZha0pGWVZkMFVFMXVUbkJsYTNSM1kycG9NR1ZWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/8894208471700630640/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhY1dORVJsZFZha0pGWVZkMFVFMXVUbkJsYTNSM1kycG9NR1ZWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8894208471700630640/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhY1dORVJsZFZha0pGWVZkMFVFMXVUbkJsYTNSM1kycG9NR1ZWUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,3532,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25acWNERldVakJFYVd0UE1uTnBla3R3Y2poMGVVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xfd29490fa3ec534e!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnZqcDFWUjBEaWtPMnNpektwcjh0eUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25acWNER